<title>usa: Sioux Falls hogs off $0.75/1.00 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls hogs off $0.75/1.00 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $.75 to $1.00 lower. Trading fairly active. Top $60.75 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3    220-260 lbs   60.00-60.75</p>
<p>	    260-270 lbs   59.50-60.25</p>
<p>US 2-3    270-280 lbs   58.50-59.50</p>
<p>	    280-290 lbs   57.50-58.50</p>
<p>US 3-4    290-300 lbs   56.50-57.50</p>
<p>US   4 lot near 400 lbs 51.00</p>
<p>Sows 1.00-2.00 lower. Top 55.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3    300-500 lbs    49.00-52.00</p>
<p>	    500-650 lbs    53.00-55.00</p>
</text>
